{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends say the Tower was built to reach the gods.</strong><br>But no one remembers who laid its very first stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an age long forgotten, three great families once united<br>and freed humanity from divine control.<br>Their legacy remains across the continent of Haim.<br>Their heroism lives on in the hearts of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs praise their ancient epics.<br>Stories record the journeys of those who walk today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, a new chapter begins.<br>A new ascent is at hand.<br>Once more, we challenge the Tower itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within its endless height lies not a foe\u2014<br>but the one who once sought <strong>Truth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His trials are neither for destruction nor salvation.<br>They exist for a single purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To see whether humanity can surpass its limits<br>and grasp the one truth beyond possibility.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987980?t=1761794270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987980/b8e2c631b024fbd7d42e6d530ad592f68090b72f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761794270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987980/1325f9fdbc11f98b097071f665ea664ad545af1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761794270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987980/1325f9fdbc11f98b097071f665ea664ad545af1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761794270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends say the Tower was built to reach the gods.</strong><br>But no one remembers who laid its very first stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an age long forgotten, three great families once united<br>and freed humanity from divine control.<br>Their legacy remains across the continent of Haim.<br>Their heroism lives on in the hearts of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs praise their ancient epics.<br>Stories record the journeys of those who walk today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, a new chapter begins.<br>A new ascent is at hand.<br>Once more, we challenge the Tower itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within its endless height lies not a foe\u2014<br>but the one who once sought <strong>Truth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His trials are neither for destruction nor salvation.<br>They exist for a single purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To see whether humanity can surpass its limits<br>and grasp the one truth beyond possibility.</strong></p>","developers":["\u61f6\u722a\u904a\u6232"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987980/e45d44541df08a8f29cc14988db4ed039502fe7d/header.jpg?t=1761794270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u5929\u7a7a\u4e4b\u5854","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 10/11 (32bit/64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 10/11 (32bit/64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u61f6\u722a\u904a\u6232"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age"